# ST1a2: e1m3's torch hall, the torches as id baked them wiped to flickering. The hall is
# the room demo1 crosses at 33.5 to 38.8 s, from its south-west corner: a still camera at
# fov 90 on the flame on its stand (left of centre), a wall flame on the left wall, one
# through the arch, and the far room's flames and wall torches by its carved door (right).
# The Classic box (960x600 shown 4:3), A with `r_torchflicker 0` and B flickering: B wipes
# in from the right over shot seconds 0.4 to 4.4 (file 1.4 to 5.4, smoothstep in 0.1 s
# keys), behind the tool's line, under the tool's labels; the sound is B's. On id's side
# nothing moves but the flames themselves. Brightness 0.55. 5.3 s with a second of handle
# each end. The marks are the flames.
#
# Under V3-20, "First: torches.", and V3-21, "id's mappers baked most of them into the
# walls, perfectly still: a hundred and forty-three, from the second map to the seventh."
#
# Assembly (ST1a): the 1440x1080 picture at x 240 of a black 1920x1080 frame; the edit's
# labels ("id's: light baked, still", "slop: flickering") cover the tool's.

map e1m3

duration 7.3
fps 60
size 1440x1080

preset classic
mode 960x600
display 4:3
hud off
cvar gamma 0.55

camera fixed -1380,-700,-20 at -1150,-300,10
fov 90

ab cvar r_torchflicker 0 | cvar r_torchflicker 1
ablabels ID'S: BAKED, STILL | SLOP: FLICKERING
split line
splitat 0 1
splitat 1.40 1.0000
splitat 1.50 0.9982
splitat 1.60 0.9928
splitat 1.70 0.9840
splitat 1.80 0.9720
splitat 1.90 0.9570
splitat 2.00 0.9393
splitat 2.10 0.9188
splitat 2.20 0.8960
splitat 2.30 0.8709
splitat 2.40 0.8438
splitat 2.50 0.8147
splitat 2.60 0.7840
splitat 2.70 0.7518
splitat 2.80 0.7183
splitat 2.90 0.6836
splitat 3.00 0.6480
splitat 3.10 0.6117
splitat 3.20 0.5747
splitat 3.30 0.5375
splitat 3.40 0.5000
splitat 3.50 0.4625
splitat 3.60 0.4252
splitat 3.70 0.3883
splitat 3.80 0.3520
splitat 3.90 0.3164
splitat 4.00 0.2817
splitat 4.10 0.2482
splitat 4.20 0.2160
splitat 4.30 0.1853
splitat 4.40 0.1562
splitat 4.50 0.1291
splitat 4.60 0.1040
splitat 4.70 0.0812
splitat 4.80 0.0608
splitat 4.90 0.0430
splitat 5.00 0.0280
splitat 5.10 0.0160
splitat 5.20 0.0072
splitat 5.30 0.0018
splitat 5.40 0.0000
absound b

mark f1 -1352,-432,14
mark f2 -1040,-272,38
mark f3 -1432,-256,38
mark f4 -960,-48,14
mark f5 -1144,48,38
mark f6 -544,-238,-4
mark f7 -544,-82,-4

sound on
events on
